2694_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XQZhuQ_tdnYQ7kNvwE7tqhG&_nc_oc=AdkFbbDkAjYJne2fDx6MSHrx3aHRli1o1fimPfz60-kebo0aEoIsosJ92xvGHCSO21o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvzfx685cJAQ5LZZQpc4eifT1moEyKPxtvzU_KWkpjmlw&oe=69A5809C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "f763aa0857754878a1aa0baa4c822193.png", "id": "1887493012186786", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304764_1887493015520119_8852669086761048292_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tTBs66K3os4Q7kNvwG8gjfT&_nc_oc=AdncJ4UI5hAKHLkm19ET4V0TXgvOOBo8S0IXkjJiCnoYaa4tuiS8Aze8q4yUE-EMYqk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs38LOSZyyTRS9WzW6EmWGQS0c4qwZEfriCXJ7xqc63Mg&oe=69A567B1"}, "display_name": "Astro Penguin", "keywords": ["platformer", "adventure", "penguin", "astro"], "long_description": "MARS IS MELTING! \nIts icy poles dissolve into vast oceans, and\neerie green light floods the skies.\n\nBraving the unknown, penguin astronauts\nCAPTAIN PEBBLESWORTH and MAJOR BEEKMAN\nembark on a perilous mission to uncover the truth\u2026\n\nAstro Penguin is an experimental, single-player VR platformer. Penguin astronauts have a range of locomotion abilities. They can slide, swim, glide, flap, carve, surf, rocket, grind, (stay tuned for more!). Explore Mars with realistic-feeling movement: feel the wind on your wings.", "short_description": "MARS IS MELTING! \nIts icy poles dissolve into vast oceans, and\neerie green light floods the skies.\n\nBraving the unknown, penguin astronauts\nCAPTAIN PEBBLESWORTH and MAJOR BEEKMAN\nembark on a perilous mission to uncover the truth\u2026\n\nAstro Penguin is a VR platformer. Penguin astronauts have a range of locomotion abilities. They can slide, swim, glide, flap, carve, surf, rocket, grind, (stay tuned for more!). Explore Mars with realistic-feeling movement: feel the wind on your wings."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://w